@startuml Vista de Processos – Level 2 (US 2.2.1 – Create Vessel Type)
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor Black
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    LifeLineBorderColor Black
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantBorderColor Black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
}

actor "Port Authority Officer" as Officer
participant "<<container (C4)>>\nVisualization (UI)" as UI #87CEEB
participant "<<container (C4)>>\nVisits & Manifests" as TYPES #87CEEB

activate Officer
Officer -> UI: 1: request to create a Vessel Type
activate UI
UI --> Officer: 1.1: request required data\n(name, description, capacity, constraints)
deactivate UI

Officer -> UI: 2: provide Vessel Type data
activate UI
UI -> TYPES: 2.1: create vessel type (data)
activate TYPES
TYPES --> UI: 2.1.1: creation confirmation
UI --> Officer: 2.2: display confirmation

deactivate TYPES
deactivate UI
deactivate Officer

@enduml
